   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Article XIX 2003-07</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Article XIX 2003-07</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Article 19 is a global organisation working with advocay and training on legal aspects of freedom of expression.The support is aiming at improving the work in Africa.  A sub division of the agreement is concerning a conflict study on FE in South Asia, finished in 2005.An evaluation commissioned by Sida was made during 2006-2007. OSI has reviewed the MLAU program in 2007.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Article 19 &#xe4;r en global organisation som arbetar med att fr&#xe4;mjande, analyser, och tr&#xe4;ning r&#xf6;rande media och yttrandefrihetslagstifning. St&#xf6;det syftar till att st&#xe4;rka arbetet i Afrika. En del av avtalet handlar om st&#xf6;d till en studie om yttrandefrihet och konflikt i Sydasien, avslutad 2005. Utv&#xe4;rdering 2006-2007. OSI utv&#xe4;rderade deras MLAU program 2007.</narrative>
  </description>
